  3
{\fArial|b0|i0|c0|p34;\H1.852x;GENERAL NOTES:}\P\PGRANITE - 1/2" MINUS MADISON GOLD \PMOUNDS - SOIL ON SITE/ EXISTING REWORK \PTURF - REMOVAL OF REAR/ PREP FOR POOL \PHEADER - REMOVAL OF REAR \P\PSCREENWALLS - 8X8X16 CMU - STUCCO & PAINT \PMASONRY -
  3
 INCLUDE STUCCO & PAINT \PPAINT SUPPLIED BY H/O \PBBQ - FLAGSTONE OR TILE TOP & BACKSPLASH \PGRILL  - PROVIDED BY H/O \PELP TO PROVIDE UTILITY DOOR \PGAS/PROPANE LINES TO LOCATION BY BUILDER \PVALVES - KEY  BY MCCOY. \P\PFIREPLACE - TILE ACCENTS (SE
  3
E DETAIL) \PBOULDERS - SURFACE SELECT TO BE SELECTED BY DESIGNER. \PRIP RAP: NEW TO MATCH EXISTING IF POSSIBLE  \PLIGHTING - VISTA W/ 10 GA WIRE. \PIRRIGATION: \P\pt0.1512;^ITREE VALVE \P^ISHRUB VALVE  \P^IANNUAL VALVE \P^ILAWN VALVES DEACTIVATE \P^IINST
  3
ALL NEW 6 STATION CLOCK AND VALVES \P\ptz;EMITTER SCHEDULE: \P\pt0.1512;^I1 GAL - 1 1GPH EMITTER/PLANT \P^I5 GAL - 1 5GPH EMITTER/PLANT \P^I15 GAL TREE - 3 -1 GPH EMITTERS/PLANT \P^I24" TREE - 3 - 1GPH EMITTERS/ PLANT \P^I36/48' TREE - 4 - 2 GPH EMITTERS
  3
/PLANT \P\ptz;ALL PLANT PITS TO BE MULCHED \PALL TREE PLANTING TO BE "BOTTOM WATERED" \PAGRIFORM TABS ON ALL PLANTINGS @\P \P^I^IDOUBLE STAKE ALL TREES** \P\P8-36/48 BOX \PALL PLANT MATERIAL TO BE APPROVED BY \PDESIGNER PRIOR TO PLANTING. \PPLANT SUBS
  3
TITUTION ALLOWED BY  \PAPPROVAL ONLY. \PANY CHANGES TO PLAN MUST BE DOCUMENTED \PON CHANGE ORDER PRIOR TO WORK BEING DONE. \P\PNOTE: NO WARRANTEES SHALL  APPLY TO ANY TRANSPLANTED OR POTTED EXISTING PLANT MATERIAL. \PNOTE: SLIGHT MODIFICATIONS TO HA
  1
RDSCAPE AND PLANTING PLAN MAY OCCUR DUE TO SITE CONDITIONS OR NECESSARY CONSTRUCTION. \P\PNOTE: REVISIONS AFTER PLAN HAS BEEN APPROVED WILL INCUR AN ADDITIONAL FEE.
